# LaTeX build artifacts. The PDFs are build output too: they regenerate with
# `make` and would otherwise churn as binary diffs on every edit. Force-add the
# final one when submitting:  git add -f reports/eval1.pdf
reports/*.pdf
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# Local scratch
tmp/
scratch/
